-- The positive control beside PointerLength: the same duty over a span.
-- spanLength reads the length the span carries and reaches no C, so the
-- compiler accepts it.  This is the form the safe layer over a generated
-- binding takes.
module Bindings.Probe.SpanLength is
    """
    Takes the bytes of the span, at most n of them.
    """
    generic [R: Region]
    function takes(bytes: Span[Nat8, R], n: Index): Unit
        requires n <= spanLength(bytes);
end module.
